@@ -1,7 +1,9 @@
 Next Release (TBD)
 ==================
 
-* No changes yet.
+* Add lexical scoping: ``let $name = <expr>, ... in <expr>`` expressions and
+  ``$name`` variable references (JEP-11a). Referencing an unbound variable
+  raises the new ``jmespath.exceptions.UndefinedVariable`` at evaluation time.
 
 
